Seq33 slice1 (VERIFIED; slice4 added the collision part): movement for the tick. gta2_re 10.5: ProcessCollisionAndClampVelocity_55F280.
 cm0 = cmPos; loop { g_CollisionRemainingFraction=1.0; hit = StepAndResolveCollisions;
   first pass: unmovedByCollision(+0xAA)=0; if remaining!=1.0 (something moved) or !hit -> done;
   if IsEngineAccelerates && NudgeOutOfCollision()!=0 -> ForcesToAccel+IntegrateVelocity and run ONE more pass; else done.
   second pass: if remaining still == 1.0 (blocked at once) -> linVel=0, angVel=0 }.
 cmDelta(+0,+4) = cmPos - cm0 (displacement this tick, block units). Returns hit.
